[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3]

; Persistent, editor-owned wildlife placements. Grounded birds sit on known
; flat public surfaces; airborne gull roots are their editable flight centres.
; The northern offshore rocks are the gull colony's roost, while separate
; editor-owned markers keep its daily range spread across the park and beaches.

